WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:01.541
Black Ops III

00:00:01.765 --> 00:00:03.168
recompiled natively

00:00:02.980 --> 00:00:04.265
for Apple Silicon

00:00:04.782 --> 00:00:07.057
bo3mac statically recompiles

00:00:06.869 --> 00:00:07.824
the Steam Mac

00:00:07.636 --> 00:00:08.437
build of Call

00:00:08.249 --> 00:00:09.168
of Duty Black

00:00:09.051 --> 00:00:10.053
Ops III into

00:00:09.865 --> 00:00:11.350
a native arm64

00:00:11.162 --> 00:00:11.692
app.

00:00:12.214 --> 00:00:13.110
It swaps the

00:00:12.945 --> 00:00:14.572
old Direct3D 11

00:00:14.384 --> 00:00:15.610
translation layer for

00:00:15.422 --> 00:00:16.930
Metal and MetalFX

00:00:17.096 --> 00:00:17.827
so the game

00:00:17.639 --> 00:00:18.806
keeps running after

00:00:18.617 --> 00:00:19.678
Rosetta 2 goes

00:00:19.490 --> 00:00:20.067
away

00:00:20.606 --> 00:00:21.855
The installer checks

00:00:21.667 --> 00:00:22.492
your own Steam

00:00:22.304 --> 00:00:23.789
copy and compiles

00:00:23.601 --> 00:00:24.249
locally

00:00:24.389 --> 00:00:25.756
The MIT licensed

00:00:25.568 --> 00:00:26.699
repo ships no

00:00:26.511 --> 00:00:27.643
game files so

00:00:27.455 --> 00:00:28.150
you must own

00:00:27.962 --> 00:00:28.669
the game

00:00:29.190 --> 00:00:30.204
Full story on

00:00:30.015 --> 00:00:30.911
the dashboard
